## fillable.soar -- thor-soar: 2 elaborations.

## Elaborate state scene not-filled-object-liquid -> sets liquid-contents.
## Useful for having a default value for liquid contents
sp {elaborations*elaborate*state*scene*not-filled-object-liquid
    :default
   (state <s> ^top-state <s>
              ^scene <scene>)
   (<scene> ^objects.object <object-int>)
   (<object-int> ^derived-from-input.fill-amount empty)
-->
   (<object-int> ^liquid-contents none)
}

## Elaborate state scene not-filled-object-liquid no-fill-amount -> sets liquid-contents.
sp {elaborations*elaborate*state*scene*not-filled-object-liquid*no-fill-amount
    :default
   (state <s> ^top-state <s>
              ^scene <scene>)
   (<scene> ^objects.object <object-int>)
   (<object-int> ^fillable true
                 ^fill-amount empty)
-->
   (<object-int> ^liquid-contents none)
}
